# REQUIRES: clang, llc, llvm-as, llvm-dis, mlir-translate, opt
#
# Breadth guard for the C / textual LLVM / bitcode / machine-basic-block
# corpus. Discovery is automatic, so a new input cannot sit unparsed merely
# because nobody remembered to add a hand-written RUN line.

# RUN: %python %harness/tools/check_compiler_inputs.py --llvm-bin %llvm_bin | %FileCheck %s

# CHECK: verified C -> bitcode: 64
# CHECK: verified C -> LLVM -> MLIR: 63; expected inline-asm refusals: 1
# CHECK: verified MLIR -> LLVM -> bitcode: 60
# CHECK: verified textual LLVM: 21
# CHECK: verified checked-in bitcode fresh-reparse fixpoints: 9
# CHECK: verified machine basic-block snapshots: 7
